{
    "Dialogue": [
        {
            "text": "I see... What a tragedy. First the village and then the recruits...",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 59,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 18
        },
        {
            "text": "Easy for you to say! If you hadn't sent them to their death then maybe we could have saved the village!",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "Shut up! He's... He's not the one at fault...",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "She is right, Zack. Darius isn’t the one you should turn your anger toward.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "Whatever.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "I am sorry, Zack, but that is how war is. The Archadians are trying to annihilate us, and so is Caelum.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 59,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "No matter how you slice it there will be no winners in this war unless we stop them.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "Right. And for that we need troops.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 59,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "I didn't see you on the battlefield trying to defend your own town.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "That's right. Not everyone is a fighter, but those who can protect others shouldn't hide away. That is why I was there and my daughter and my general were outside.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 59,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "Anyway, about my demand, Darius. Did you arrange it?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "A ship... It is a prized possession in times of war, but you paid us more than enough.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 59,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 9
        },
        {
            "text": "A ship?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "That's right. We'll need it to reach the Southern Continent.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "You will have to be careful, though. The high seas are crawling with pirates. Because of them, having a ship is practically worthless.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "It is waiting for you at Seafront Village.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 59,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "There something else. I'd like her to come with us.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "What?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "What?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "Mir, please you must reconsider...",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 59,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "I've been stuck in the city for years. Please Dad, let me go with them. At Mir's side, I would be even safer than here!",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "It's not like you need any of us to protect you, seeing how you fought.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "Right.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "Don't I get a say in this?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "Looks like you just got demoted to underling! I'm the new boss!",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "Also, Sieg, can you go with them?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 59,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "But I just go back...",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 5,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "She'll need strong companions. I can't force you, but please consider going with them.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 59,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "Who knows, we might be able to visit some ruins in our travels.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "Fine, fine. I'm coming.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 5,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "Great. Gusto, you'll also be going with them.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 59,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "Yes, Sir.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 8,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "I feel a sense of déjà vu.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 2,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "Tell me about it.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 1,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        }
    ]
}